  "prompt": "For each promotion, what was the average net revenue per day of its run? Take the net revenue of the order lines that carry the promotion's promo_id (quantity times unit_price_eur, minus line_discount_eur), and divide it by the number of days the promotion ran, with both its start_date and its end_date counted. Round to 2 decimals. Return two columns, in this order: promo_code, and revenue_per_day. Return one row for each promotion with at least one such line. Any row order is fine.",
